@startuml EduPules_Sequence_Alert
' Implemented flow: frontend/src/pages/dean/DeanAlerts.tsx -> backend/app/api/analytics_extended.py
actor Admin
participant "React SPA" as SPA
participant "FastAPI" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
Admin -> SPA : 1. open Alerts page
SPA -> API : 2. GET /api/v1/analytics/system-alerts (Bearer JWT)
activate API
API -> API : 3. verify JWT & staff role
API -> DB : 4. rule queries (risk_assessments, students,\nattendances, intervention_plans, quiz_submissions)
DB --> API : rows
API --> SPA : 5. 200 alerts JSON
deactivate API
SPA --> Admin : 6. alert cards
Admin -> SPA : 7. click "Send warning"
SPA -> API : 8. POST /api/v1/analytics/alerts/{id}/send-warning
activate API
API -> DB : 9. INSERT notification (audit record for sender)
API --> SPA : 10. success
deactivate API
note over API, DB : Delivery of the warning to the student is planned (not implemented).
@enduml
